{"id":"CVE-2013-4489","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2014-05-17T20:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T16:45:14.836Z","description":"The Grit gem for Ruby, as used in GitLab 5.2 before 5.4.1 and 6.x before 6.2.3, allows remote authenticated users to execute arbitrary commands, as demonstrated by the search box for the GitLab code search feature.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://www.gitlab.com/2013/11/04/gitlab-ce-6-2-and-5-4-security-release/","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]}],"vendors":["gitlab"]}
{"id":"CVE-2013-4490","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2014-05-13T15:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T16:45:14.763Z","description":"The SSH key upload feature (lib/gitlab_keys.rb) in gitlab-shell before 1.7.3, as used in GitLab 5.0 before 5.4.1 and 6.x before 6.2.3, allows remote authenticated users to execute arbitrary commands via shell metacharacters in the public key.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://www.gitlab.com/2013/11/04/gitlab-ce-6-2-and-5-4-security-release/","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]}],"exploitdb":[{"edb":"34362","title":"Gitlab-shell - Code Execution (Metasploit)","type":"remote","platform":"linux","date":"2014-08-19","verified":"1"}],"vendors":["gitlab"]}
{"id":"CVE-2013-4546","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2014-05-13T15:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T16:45:15.033Z","description":"The repository import feature in gitlab-shell before 1.7.4, as used in GitLab, allows remote authenticated users to execute arbitrary commands via the import URL.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://www.gitlab.com/2013/11/08/security-vulnerability-in-gitlab-shell/","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2013/11/11/2","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20131111 Security vulnerability in gitlab-shell (CVE-2013-4546)"},{"url":"https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/gitlab-shell/blob/master/CHANGELOG","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]}],"vendors":["gitlab"]}
